---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<aside class="dashboard-notes" id="local-notes" data-notes aria-labelledby="notes-heading">
  <header class="notes-heading">
    <h2 id="notes-heading">Notas locales</h2>
    <span class="notes-location"><Icon name="device" />Este navegador</span>
  </header>
  <div class="notes-empty" data-notes-empty hidden>
    <Icon name="note" />
    <h3>Un espacio para recordar</h3>
    <p>Añade una nota para tenerla a mano en este dispositivo.</p>
  </div>
  <ul class="notes-list" id="notesList" data-notes-list hidden></ul>
  <form id="notesForm" method="post" data-notes-form>
    <fieldset data-notes-fields disabled>
      <legend class="visually-hidden">Añadir una nota local</legend>
      <label for="noteTitle">Título de la nota</label>
      <input id="noteTitle" type="text" placeholder="Por ejemplo, entorno de pruebas" autocomplete="off" required />
      <label for="noteSecret">Contenido</label>
      <textarea id="noteSecret" rows="3" placeholder="Escribe un recordatorio" autocomplete="off" required></textarea>
      <button class="dashboard-primary" type="submit"><Icon name="plus" />Añadir nota</button>
    </fieldset>
  </form>
  <p class="notes-warning">Sin cifrado ni sincronización. No guardes contraseñas ni claves.</p>
  <p class="notes-error" data-notes-error role="alert" hidden></p>
  <button class="notes-retry" type="button" data-notes-retry hidden>Volver a intentar</button>
  <p class="notes-status" data-notes-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <noscript><p class="notes-warning">Activa JavaScript para consultar y guardar notas en este navegador.</p></noscript>
</aside>
<script>
  import { mountNotes } from './notes';
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-notes]').forEach(root => mountNotes(root));
</script>
